# Wire features into UI (Coming soon → working)

## Owner expectation

Feature banate hi **silent / hidden** mat chhodo. User ko UI mein dikhna chahiye ki feature exist karta hai — pehle **Coming soon**, jab flow ready ho tab real working.

## Protocol (har naya feature)

1. **Same chat / PR — pehle UI wire**
   - Agent web: sidebar / Wallet menu / dashboard tile / Settings tab — jahan user naturally dhundhega
   - Admin: matching nav / section
   - Mobile: tab / home tile / stack (InstantPay parity — see `AGENTS.md`)
2. **Incomplete flow** → entrypoint **visible** with English **Coming soon** (tap → toast/modal: short “Coming soon” message). No dead blank page.
3. **Complete + working** → Coming soon hatao; real flow unlock; checklist / task file update.
4. Backend-only stub + orphan route **forbidden**.

## Placement examples

- Fund request / Add Money → under **Wallet** (not lone sidebar orphan)
- Wallet cluster: Overview · Add Money · Transfer · Statement
- New money rails → Wallet or the service category they belong to

## Done check

- [ ] Entrypoint reachable from nav / obvious CTA (not only by URL)
- [ ] Incomplete = **Coming soon** in UI (English)
- [ ] Complete = working happy path (web + mobile if agent-facing)
- [ ] Role gating matches API
- [ ] Label English (`ui-english-only`)

## Do not

- Feature “done” claim when only API exists
- Hide incomplete work until “later wire”
- Hinglish “Coming soon” copy in product UI
